# Local development only. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real values:
# this repository is public.
#
# In production both are Worker secrets, set from the operator's shell:
#   npx wrangler secret put TAVUS_TOOL_SECRET
#   npx wrangler secret put OPERATOR_KEY
#
# TAVUS_TOOL_SECRET  The shared secret Tavus signs each tool call with (delivery.api.auth.secret on
#                    the tool, auth.type "hmac"). The Worker refuses every tool call without it.
# OPERATOR_KEY       Bearer key for the /operator routes (issue a claim, resolve a hold, settle).
#                    The Worker refuses every operator call without it.
TAVUS_TOOL_SECRET=
OPERATOR_KEY=
